# Minimum number of host gtest cases that must RUN in CI (#390).
# Checked by tests/tools/check_test_count.py after the unit-test step.
#
# A floor, not an exact count. When your PR adds tests, raise this to the new
# total in the same PR. When it removes tests on purpose, lower it -- the
# reduction then shows up in the diff instead of passing silently.
#
# Set to the count after #411's FirmwareInfo tests (main @ e2d00c5 + #461):
# 1259 tests from 176 suites.
1259
